      "refersTo": "window",
      "description": "Paper window with lavender caption and decorative dots.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-window\"><div class=\"ds-titlebar\"><span>getting-started.txt</span><div class=\"ds-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"ds-content\"><h3>Make yourself at home.</h3><p>Install Bun 1.4 or newer, clone the repo, then connect your tools.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-window{border:2px solid var(--ink,#101317);border-radius:12px;background:var(--paper,#fdfdfb);color:var(--ink,#101317);overflow:hidden;font-family:Bricolage,sans-serif}.ds-titlebar{min-height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:8px 22px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink,#101317);background:var(--bar,#c0b4f1);font:14px/1.3 var(--mono,\"DM Mono\",monospace)}.ds-dots{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-dots i{width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid var(--ink,#101317);border-radius:50%;background:var(--orange,#ff793e)}.ds-dots i:nth-child(2){background:#f5da73}.ds-dots i:nth-child(3){background:#54b76b}.ds-content{padding:28px}.ds-content h3{margin:0;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-content p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin:14px 0}"
    },
